        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kaganoi Shigemochi, Muramasa Sengo, Hideyoshi\n- Roles: swordsmith\n- Products: Muramasa blade\n- Organizations: Muramasa school\n- Places: Japan\n- Periods: Muromachi period\n\nFacts:\n- Muramasa Sengo was a famous Japanese swordsmith who founded the Muramasa school and lived during Japan's Muromachi period, from the 14th to the 16th centuries.\n- In 1598, Hideyoshi bestowed Kaganoi Shigemochi with a blade made by Muramasa.",
